			Ὑμεναίῳ</span> ib.<i><span class="en">
				29.156
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b> metaph., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-έρρανται στιγμαῖς</span>”
